---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About | Bhagyashri Patil — Product, Solutions Engineering & AI">
<header class="hero">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <span class="eyebrow">About / Product thinking · Solutions engineering · Applied AI</span>
    <h1><span class="intro">Hi, I'm Bhagyashri.</span>I connect business problems with <em>products and solutions that create value.</em></h1>
    <p>With 7+ years of experience building enterprise analytics and data solutions in product-focused environments, I bring hands-on engineering depth to product decisions, stakeholder needs, and scalable solution design. I'm growing at the intersection of product management, cloud architecture, and applied AI.</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="button primary" href="#accomplishments">See accomplishments ↘</a>
      <a class="button secondary" href="/projects/">Explore my work ↗</a>
    </div>
    <p class="availability"><span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> Exploring Boston, MA and remote opportunities</p>
  </div>

</header>

<section id="accomplishments" class="section accomplishments" aria-labelledby="accomplishments-heading">
  <div class="section-row"><span class="eyebrow">01 / Accomplishments</span><div><h2 id="accomplishments-heading">Highlights that speak for themselves.</h2><p>A few milestones that reflect my technical foundation, published work, and ability to communicate through data.</p></div></div>
  <div class="proof-grid">
    <article class="proof-card"><span class="eyebrow">External recognition / 2022</span><h3>Tableau Public Featured Author</h3><p>Selected for Tableau's <em>Featured Authors: Back to School Edition</em>, highlighting my data visualization work.</p><a href="https://www.tableau.com/blog/featured-authors-back-school-edition" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read Tableau's feature ↗</a></article>
    <article class="proof-card"><span class="eyebrow">Research / Publications</span><h3>Published research in assistive technology</h3><p>Co-authored research on camera-based text and product-label reading for people with visual impairments.</p><a href="/projects/#publications">View publications ↗</a></article>
    <article class="proof-card"><span class="eyebrow">Professional foundation</span><h3>7+ years in enterprise data solutions</h3><p>Hands-on experience across analytics, system delivery, stakeholder requirements, and technical problem-solving in product-oriented environments.</p><a href="/experience/">Explore my experience ↗</a></article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="approach-heading">
  <div class="section-row"><span class="eyebrow">02 / How I work</span><div><h2 id="approach-heading">Product thinking backed by engineering depth.</h2><p>I'm most energized by understanding the customer problem, mapping the trade-offs, and connecting the right technology to a useful outcome. My foundation in analytics and solution delivery provides a practical perspective for product and architecture conversations across industries.</p></div></div>
  <div class="capabilities">
    <div><span class="eyebrow">Product</span><h3>Define the right problem</h3><p>Stakeholder discovery, prioritization, requirements, and meaningful measures of success.</p></div>
    <div><span class="eyebrow">Solutions</span><h3>Design for the real world</h3><p>Systems thinking, data integration, architecture considerations, and delivery trade-offs.</p></div>
    <div><span class="eyebrow">Data & AI</span><h3>Make technology useful</h3><p>Enterprise data products, machine learning experience, and an evolving focus on applied AI.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="work-heading">
  <div class="section-row"><span class="eyebrow">03 / Selected work</span><div><h2 id="work-heading">Proof through projects.</h2><p>Explore work through the lens of business context, product questions, solution design, and technical decisions. More cloud, product, and applied-AI case studies will join the portfolio as they're ready to share.</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="button primary" href="/projects/">View case studies ↗</a>
      <a class="button secondary" href="https://public.tableau.com/app/profile/bhagyashri.patil" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Tableau Public ↗</a>
      <a class="button secondary" href="/projects/#publications">Publications →</a>
    </div>
  </div></div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="personal-heading">
  <div class="section-row"><span class="eyebrow">04 / Beyond the résumé</span><div class="personal-grid"><div><h2 id="personal-heading">Curious beyond the screen.</h2><p>Outside work, photography gives me another way to notice patterns, perspectives, and details that are easy to miss. A small collection of my favorite photographs lives in Beyond Work.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button secondary" href="/beyond-work/">Explore photography ↗</a></div></div><a class="personal-photo" href="/beyond-work/" aria-label="Explore my photography"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1644777122204-907ec31b0538?auto=format&fit=crop&w=760&q=80" alt="Coastal landscape at Torrey Pines photographed by Bhagyashri Patil" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></a></div></div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="connect-heading">
  <div class="section-row"><span class="eyebrow">05 / Let's connect</span><div><h2 id="connect-heading">Building what's next.</h2><p>I'm interested in product management and solutions engineering opportunities in the Boston area or remote, including teams building cloud-enabled, data-intensive, and AI-aware products in finance, banking, real estate, technology, and beyond.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="/contact/">Get in touch ↗</a><a class="button secondary" href="/experience/">Full experience →</a></div></div></div>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
.hero{display:block;padding:clamp(54px,6vw,88px) 0 clamp(56px,6vw,78px)}.hero-copy{min-width:0;max-width:1010px}.hero h1{max-width:930px;font-size:clamp(2.25rem,3.65vw,3.85rem)}.intro{display:block;font-size:clamp(1.3rem,1.7vw,1.85rem);font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin-bottom:15px}.hero h1 em{font-style:normal;color:inherit}.hero p{max-width:800px}.availability{margin-top:28px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;color:#51637e;font-size:.89rem;font-weight:650}.status-dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#4da98b;display:inline-block;flex:none}
.proof-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:clamp(19px,3vw,42px);margin-top:30px}.proof-card{padding:20px 0 0;border:0;border-top:1px solid #d6d6d3;background:transparent;border-radius:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.proof-card h3{font-size:1.24rem;margin:17px 0 10px}.proof-card p{font-size:.96rem;flex:1;margin:0 0 21px}.proof-card a{font-size:.88rem;font-weight:700;color:#343c4a;align-self:flex-start;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}.proof-card a:hover{text-decoration:underline}
.capabilities{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:18px;margin-top:32px}.capabilities>div{padding:20px 0;border-top:1px solid #d6d6d3}.capabilities h3{margin:13px 0 8px}.capabilities p{font-size:.95rem;margin:0}.personal-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .6fr;gap:clamp(25px,5vw,76px);align-items:center}.personal-photo{display:block;overflow:hidden;border-radius:17px;background:#e6eaf0}.personal-photo img{width:100%;height:100%;display:block;object-fit:cover;aspect-ratio:1.5}
@media(max-width:800px){.proof-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.capabilities{grid-template-columns:1fr}.personal-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}@media(max-width:600px){.hero{padding:var(--page-intro-top) 0 var(--page-intro-bottom)}.proof-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.personal-photo{max-width:520px}}
</style>
